          "type": "field",
          "key": "devices"
        },
        {
          "type": "notice",
          "tone": "info",
          "text": "Pair a phone, a browser or a desktop to this org on the hub with fleet-hub pair --org and the org's name. Unbind one with fleet-hub client unbind, or revoke it with fleet-hub client revoke."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
